      "width": 620.1,
      "height": 56.25,
      "text": "S3 and DynamoDB use prefix-list routes. No endpoint ENIs or security groups.\nDynamoDB remains provisioned but is not used by this RDS design.\nPrivate subnets have no internet default route; DNS support + hostnames are enabled.",
